# ---------------- Project-generated artifacts ----------------
# train.csv/test.csv are training-time byproducts, safe to regenerate locally.
# model.pkl, preprocessor.pkl, and data.csv ARE tracked below (deliberately) —
# app.py needs them at runtime, and retraining on Render would take far too
# long for a build step.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/model.pkl
!artifacts/preprocessor.pkl
!artifacts/data.csv
catboost_info/
logs/

